<p>India me lakhs log roz photos ko jodne ke liye mehenge apps download karte hain — jo ya to paani (watermark) lagati hain, ya photos server par upload karke privacy khatam karti hain, ya ads se bhari hoti hain.</p>
<p>Hamara mission simple hai: <b>ek aisa tool dena jo 100% free ho, 100% private ho, aur bina kisi jhanjhat ke kaam kare</b> — chahe aap mobile use karo ya computer.</p>

<h2>✨ PhotoJod ki khashiyatein</h2>
<ul>
  <li><b>100% Private</b> — aapki photos kahin upload NAHI hoti. Sab kuch aapke hi browser me hota hai.</li>
  <li><b>Full Quality</b> — photo ki original quality kabhi nahi ghatti. PNG 100% lossless hai.</li>
  <li><b>Crop & Rotate</b> — har photo ko crop karo (1:1, 4:3, 16:9 ratios ke sath) aur rotate karo.</li>
  <li><b>8 Photos tak</b> — grid collage banao, background color badlo, border/gap set karo.</li>
  <li><b>Watermark Option</b> — apna naam/brand photo par lagao.</li>
  <li><b>Bina Internet</b> — ek baar page khul gaya to internet band bhi chalega.</li>
  <li><b>Bilkul Free</b> — na login, na signup, na hidden charges.</li>
</ul>

<h2>🛠️ Kaise kaam karta hai?</h2>
<p>PhotoJod aapke browser ki <b>modern technology (HTML5 Canvas)</b> se bana hai. Jab aap photo choose karte ho, wo sirf aapke device ki memory me load hoti hai. Combining, cropping, sab processing aapke hi device par hoti hai — isliye ye itna fast aur private hai.</p>

