<h1>Frequently Asked Questions (FAQ)</h1>
<p>Yahan PhotoJod ke baare me sabse common sawaalon ke jawaab hain. Agar aapka sawaal yahan nahi hai to <a href="contact.html" style="color:#a5b4fc">Contact page</a> par message karo.</p>

<h2>🔒 Privacy ke sawaal</h2>

<h3>Kya meri photos kahin upload hoti hain?</h3>
<p><b>Nahi!</b> Aapki photos kabhi kahin nahi jati. Sab processing aapke hi browser me hoti hai — na koi server, na koi cloud. Chahe aap internet band kar do, tab bhi tool kaam karega.</p>

<h3>Kya tool mujhe kaunsa bata sakta hai?</h3>
<p>Aapki photos to device par hi rehti hain, par tool aapki kuch settings (jaise business banner) aapke browser ke localStorage me save karta hai — ye sirf aapke device par rehta hai, humein kabhi nahi milta.</p>

<h2>📸 Features ke sawaal</h2>

<h3>Kitni photos jodh sakte hain?</h3>
<p>Ek collage me <b>8 photos tak</b> jodh sakte ho. 2 photos ke liye classic side-by-side, zyada photos ke liye grid layout best hai.</p>

<h3>Kya photo quality kam hoti hai?</h3>
<p><b>Nahi.</b> PhotoJod full resolution me kaam karta hai — aapki photo jitni badi hai, output utni hi banegi (80 megapixel tak support). PNG format 100% lossless hai. Quality report me har photo ka "✓ 1:1 original pixels" status dekh sakte ho.</p>

<h3>Kya mobile phone par chalega?</h3>
<p><b>Haan!</b> Android, iPhone, tablet — sab par chalta hai. Touch se crop bhi kar sakte ho.</p>

<h3>Kaunse photo formats support hain?</h3>
<p>JPG, PNG, WebP, GIF, BMP — browser jo bhi support karta hai. Download PNG ya JPG me hota hai.</p>

<h3>Crop kaise hota hai? Ratio kaise set karu?</h3>
<p>Photo slot par ✂️ button dabao. Box drag karke crop karo, ya 1:1 (WhatsApp DP), 4:3, 16:9 jaise ready ratios chuno. ⟲⟳ se photo ghuma bhi sakte ho.</p>

<h3>Watermark kaise lagau?</h3>
<p>Setting me "Watermark lagao" checkbox ON karo, apna naam likho aur position chuno. Ye photographers aur service walon ke liye best hai.</p>

<h2>💾 Download ke sawaal</h2>

<h3>PNG ya JPG — kya chunu?</h3>
<table>
  <tr><th>Format</th><th>Kab use karein</th></tr>
  <tr><td><b>PNG</b></td><td>Best quality chahiye, printing karni hai, ya transparent background chahiye</td></tr>
  <tr><td><b>JPG</b></td><td>File chhoti chahiye — WhatsApp/Instagram ke liye (quality slider 95%+ rakho)</td></tr>
</table>

<h3>Download button kaam nahi kar raha, kya karu?</h3>
<p>Agar aap kisi app ke andar wale preview me ho, to <b>is page ko apne device par save karke seedha Chrome/Edge me kholo</b> — wahan download 100% kaam karega. Ya image par right-click → "Save image as" karo.</p>

<h2>💰 Business ke sawaal</h2>

<h3>Kya main is tool se business kar sakta hoon?</h3>
<p>Bilkul! Collage design service shuru karo — customer ki photos lo, PhotoJod se banao (5 min me), watermark preview bhejo, payment lo, final file do. <b>₹49–299 per collage</b> easily charge kar sakte ho.</p>

<h3>Kya ye sach me free hai?</h3>
<p><b>Haan, 100% free.</b> Na login, na signup, na hidden charges, na photo limit.</p>

